rows.en:
Whoa, amazing! You got it!
That's right.
Things in our classroom kept disappearing all the time.{p}

The one people suspected most was Shimada.
...The cheer squad guy I mentioned.
Because the thefts started right when the dustpan disappeared.{p}

It bugged me that the victims were all girls, but even so, I just couldn't see Shimada or the other boys in class being the thief...
And besides...
Something weird a friend of mine said was bugging me.{p}

Yeah, I thought so.
You just seem like that kind of person, {a}.
...Not that I mean anything deep by it.{p}
